==Battleground==
*7 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Cadaver Bear]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn as bosses, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
When the enemy base is attacked, Assassin Bears will spawn and destroy your base in a matter of seconds. However, the enemy limit here is 7, so this will only happen if two of the previously-spawned enemies have been vanquished. Do not bring any [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]], as they will kill the Coffin Zoges.

A simple strategy that works on all crowns is to destroy the enemy base before Cadaver Bear destroys yours. Bring Starting Money UP Cat Combos like [[Offshore Accounts (Combo)|Offshore Accounts]], [[Bento Special (Combo)|Bento Special]], and [[Bouncing Four (Combo)|Bouncing Four]] in order to spawn units faster. Spawn a fast meatshield, like a couple [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cats]] or a [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]], as soon as possible to let the Coffin Zoges stack up. When all seven Coffin Zoges are fully stacked behind the meatshield and Cadaver Bear is in the middle of burying, spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. It'll be able to immediately kill the stack of Coffin Zoges and destroy the base right before Cadaver Bear inflicts damage upon your own. If necessary, further stall the Cadaver Bear after spawning Bahamut by spamming meatshields.

Alternatively, a brute-force strategy of killing Cadaver Bear twice without Zombie Killers is possible but becomes increasingly unreasonable on higher crowns.

